OL,3,AKrakow market square reopens after
OL,4,Adeadly shooting as witness recalls
OL,5,A'panic unfolding around us'
OL,6,
OL,7,FKrakow's market square fully reopens
OL,8,Ffor the first time a day after six
OL,9,Fpeople were killed in a shooting -
OL,10,Fhere's what we know
OL,12,FOf the 16 others injured in the attack,
OL,13,F15 are now stable, including two police
OL,14,Fofficers who have emerged from comas -
OL,15,Fthe suspect remains in critical
OL,16,Fcondition
OL,18,FThree more bodies were found at the
OL,19,Fsuspect's home, and were later
OL,20,Fidentified as the man's parents and
OL,21,Fsister
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
