OL,3,AKrakow market square reopens after
OL,4,Adeadly shooting as witness recalls
OL,5,A'panic unfolding around us'
OL,6,
OL,7,FEyewitness Tom Brook tells the BBC he
OL,8,F"kept seeing people who'd been shot" in
OL,9,Fthe aftermath of the attack; another,
OL,10,FDarren Young, says he and his family
OL,11,F"witnessed panic unfolding around us"
OL,13,FThe Krakow branch of Poland's National
OL,14,FProsecutor's Office says the shooting
OL,15,Fin the city centre constitutes "a
OL,16,Fterrorist offence"
OL,18,FLate on Saturday, Poland's interior
OL,19,Fminister described the suspect - a
OL,20,FPolish man - as being inspired by
OL,21,F"far-right ideologies"; police said he
OL,22,Fused "military weapons" in the attack
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
